<view class="page" wx:if="{{!loading}}">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-main">
        <text class="row-label">提前几天提醒我</text>
        <text class="row-desc muted">{{pushFeatureOn ? '还剩这么多天的时候，就开始提醒你买' : '还剩这么多天的时候，就出现在首页的「该买了」里'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stepper">
        <text class="step-btn" data-delta="-1" bindtap="changeDays">−</text>
        <text class="step-value">{{remindDays}}</text>
        <text class="step-btn" data-delta="1" bindtap="changeDays">＋</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="row" wx:if="{{pushFeatureOn}}">
      <view class="row-main">
        <text class="row-label">每天几点推</text>
        <text class="row-desc muted">每天最多推一条汇总，不会一条条轰炸你。只能选整点。</text>
      </view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{hourOptions}}" value="{{hourIndex}}" bindchange="onTimeChange">
        <view class="time-picker">{{pushTime}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="row" wx:if="{{pushFeatureOn}}">
      <view class="row-main">
        <text class="row-label">开启提醒</text>
        <text class="row-desc muted">关掉之后就只能自己进小程序看了</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{pushEnabled}}" color="#FF7A45" bindchange="onSwitch" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card list" wx:if="{{pushFeatureOn}}">
    <view class="row" bindtap="preview">
      <view class="row-main">
        <text class="row-label">预览提醒内容</text>
        <text class="row-desc muted">看看真到点会推什么，不用等到第二天早上</text>
      </view>
      <text class="row-value muted">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card push-off" wx:else>
    <text class="push-off-title">微信推送暂时关闭</text>
    <text class="row-desc muted push-off-desc">
      「该买了」的清单仍然会在首页按时出现，只是不会给你发微信消息。
    </text>
  </view>

  <view class="card quota {{lowQuota ? 'quota-low' : ''}}" wx:if="{{pushFeatureOn}}">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="row-label">提醒次数余额</text>
      <text class="quota-num">{{quota}} 次</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row-desc muted quota-desc">
      微信规定：用户每授权一次，小程序才能推一条消息。所以余额用完前需要再点一下续订。
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm renew" bindtap="renew">续订提醒次数</button>
  </view>

  <button
    class="btn btn-primary save {{(!changed || saving) ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}"
    bindtap="save"
    disabled="{{!changed || saving}}"
  >
    {{saving ? '保存中…' : (changed ? '保存设置' : '已保存')}}
  </button>
  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>

<view class="empty" wx:else>正在加载…</view>
